  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A weapon crafted by scientists from the planet <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Empress_Teta\" title=\"Empress Teta\">Empress Teta</a>, the Carbonite Rifle fires a short stream of liquid carbonite that solidifies on contact with a target. Any target moved down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> by this weapon is also <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Immobilized\" title=\"Immobilized\">Immobilized</a> until the end of its next turn. </p><p>A Carbonite Rifle requires special carbonite cartridges, which each cost 50 credits and weigh 1 kg. After 20 shots, the carbonite cartridge must be replaced. </p>",
